      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even if you feel you know your body, the combination of heart palpitations and shortness of breath are not symptoms to self-treat without a medical opinion. Taking high doses of supplements, especially when dealing with cardiac or respiratory symptoms, can sometimes interact with your body in unexpected ways. Please consider reaching out to a nurse helpline or a community health clinic for initial, low-cost guidance before self-medicating.",
      "source": "target",
